.\" Outsider — Man Page
.TH OUS 1 "2026-08-02" "ous 0.7.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ous \- Outsider: the Cudane package builder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ous
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ous
builds and packages Cudane software into self-extracting archives (.xcs), and
provides build-aware prompts, plugins, themes, and TUIs via the shared cps
engine.
.br
It reads a manifest describing the build, stages the build output, and wraps it
as a distributable archive. When run without a package operation it renders a
build-aware prompt using the registered theme.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-a, \-\-archive \fIDIR\fR [\fIOUT.xcs\fR]
Stage and package the built tree in
.I DIR
into an \fI.xcs\fR archive.
.TP
.B \-x, \-\-extract \fIFILE.xcs\fR
Unpack an \fI.xcs\fR archive.
.TP
.B \-w, \-\-write \fIFILE\fR
Generate package metadata for a manually constructed package.
.TP
.B \-b, \-\-hash-type \fIHASH\fR
Select the checksum algorithm used for the archive.
.TP
.B \-\-plugin \fIlist|register|unregister|run\fR ...
Manage cps plugins (run takes \fIname\fR [\fIfunc\fR] [\fIargs ...\fR]).
.TP
.B \-\-theme \fIlist|register|unregister|apply\fR ...
Manage cps themes (\fIapply\fR renders a theme's prompt).
.TP
.B \-\-tui \fIlist|register|unregister|run\fR ...
Manage cps TUIs.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I manifest.toml
Build manifest consumed by
.BR ous .
.TP
.I t.desc , p.desc
Theme and plugin descriptor files.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cps (1),
.BR mcx (1)
